    <briefdescription>
<para>Class to create a Pulse Width Modulated (PWM) signal on the Raspberry PI 4 and 5. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Based on <ulink url="https://github.com/berndporr/rpi_pwm/blob/main/rpi_pwm.h">https://github.com/berndporr/rpi_pwm/blob/main/rpi_pwm.h</ulink> and slightly modified.</para>
<para>For servo control it is important to use a hardware generated PWM, since software PWM, like it is created by the lgpio library, is subject to timing jitter which can cause the servo to figet which might lead to overheating and wear. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
